                   transition-all duration-300 ease-out group-hover:w-[60%]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\"></span></a></nav><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-2 md:flex\"><a class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white\r\n\n                       transition-all duration-300 ease-out\r\n\n                       hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(235,66,3,0.35)]\r\n\n                       active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\"><span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-1.5\">Upload Image<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full bg-gradient-to-r\r\n\n                         from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent\r\n\n                         transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-full\"></span></a></div><button aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300 md:hidden\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\"><div class=\"relative h-4 w-5\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;top:2px;transform:none\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-[7px] h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;opacity:1;transform:none\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 h-[2px] w-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;top:12px;transform:none\"></span></div></button></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 top-0 -z-10 md:hidden transition-opacity duration-300\n          pointer-events-none opacity-0\" style=\"background:rgba(255, 241, 239, 0.96);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)\"><div class=\"mt-20 flex flex-col gap-2 px-6 transition-all duration-500\n            -translate-y-4 opacity-0\"><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300\r\n\n                         hover:bg-[rgba(235,66,3,0.08)] hover:pl-5\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a;font-family:&#x27;Space Grotesk&#x27;, sans-serif;transition-delay:0ms\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white\r\n\n                       transition-transform duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"background:#EB4203\" href=\"/#upload\">Upload Image →</a><p class=\"mt-6 px-4 text-center text-xs\" style=\"color:#8a7a77\">Free · No signup · No uploads</p></div></div></header><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://bgremove.ankuaitools.com/#webapp\",\"name\":\"BgRemove\",\"url\":\"https://bgremove.ankuaitools.com\",\"description\":\"A free online background remover that processes selected images in the browser and exports transparent PNGs.\",\"applicationCategory\":\"MultimediaApplication\",\"applicationSubCategory\":\"Background Removal\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Any (Web Browser)\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript and WebAssembly\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"featureList\":[\"AI background removal\",\"Transparent PNG export\",\"Browser-based image processing\",\"No account required\",\"Supports PNG, JPG, WEBP\"],\"screenshot\":\"https://bgremove.ankuaitools.com/og-image.png\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://bgremove.ankuaitools.com\"}]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I remove an image background online for free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. BgRemove is free to use in your browser and does not require an account. The downloaded PNG has no BgRemove watermark.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is my image uploaded for processing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The selected image is processed in your browser using WebAssembly, rather than sent to BgRemove's application server. Your browser still requests the website and model files needed to run the tool.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the downloaded PNG contain?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"By default, the cutout is centered on a 3840 × 2160 canvas with transparent space around it. If you choose a solid editor background, the PNG uses that color instead. Enlarging a small original does not restore missing detail.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I add a white background instead of transparency?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. After processing, choose Edit & Crop and select White in the background controls. You can also keep the background transparent or choose black or the brand color.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What image formats are supported?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The tool accepts PNG, JPG, and WEBP images and downloads a PNG.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will the cutout preserve every fine edge?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Results depend on the image, subject, contrast, and device. Inspect hair, translucent areas, and similar fine edges; no automatic remover can guarantee a perfect result for every photo.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use an edited photo for an ID or passport application?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The tool can create a cutout, but photo rules vary by issuing authority and may restrict edits. Check the current official requirements before submitting an edited image.\"}}]}</script><main class=\"overflow-x-hidden\"><section id=\"upload\"><style>\n@keyframes floaty {\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }\n  50% { transform: translateY(-18px) scale(1.06); }\n}\n@keyframes pulseRing {\n  0% { transform: scale(0.85); opacity: 0.6; }\n  70% { transform: scale(1.25); opacity: 0; }\n  100% { transform: scale(1.25); opacity: 0; }\n}\n@keyframes shimmer {\n  0% { background-position: -200% 0; }\n  100% { background-position: 200% 0; }\n}\n@keyframes fadeUp {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n@keyframes dotBounce {\n  0%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.4; }\n  40% { transform: translateY(-4px); opacity: 1; }\n}\n@keyframes spinSlow {\n  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n@keyframes ripple {\n  from { transform: scale(0); opacity: 1; }\n  to { transform: scale(28); opacity: 0; }\n}\n@keyframes uploadBob {\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }\n  50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }\n}\n@keyframes dropPulse {\n  0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(235,66,3,0.35), 0 20px 60px rgba(235,66,3,0.25); }\n  50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(235,66,3,0), 0 20px 60px rgba(235,66,3,0.35); }\n}\n@keyframes editorIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px) scale(0.98); }\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *, *::before, *::after {\n    animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;\n  }\n}\n</style><div class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden px-3 py-24 sm:px-6\" style=\"background:#fff1ef;color:#0a0a0a\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -left-24 top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl\" style=\"background:#EB4203;animation:floaty 9s ease-in-out infinite\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 bottom-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl\" style=\"background:#0a0a0a;animation:floaty 12s ease-in-out infinite reverse\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] text-center\"><div class=\"mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.10);color:#EB4203;border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.25)\"><span class=\"inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:#EB4203\"></span>Free · No Account · In-Browser Processing</div><h1 class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl pb-2 text-4xl font-black leading-[1.1] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Remove Image Background <span style=\"color:#EB4203\">for Free</span></h1></div><div style=\"animation:fadeUp 0.55s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both\"><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Upload an image to remove its background\" class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed p-8 py-10 text-center backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 ease-out outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 bg-white/70 shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.99]\" style=\"border-color:#EB4203;--tw-ring-color:#EB4203;animation:none\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute h-3 w-3 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"left:0.75rem;top:0.75rem;delay:0ms;background:#EB4203;opacity:0;transform:scale(0);transition-delay:0ms\"></span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute h-3 w-3 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"right:0.75rem;top:0.75rem;delay:80ms;background:#EB4203;opacity:0;transform:scale(0);transition-delay:80ms\"></span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute h-3 w-3 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"left:0.75rem;bottom:0.75rem;delay:160ms;background:#EB4203;opacity:0;transform:scale(0);transition-delay:160ms\"></span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute h-3 w-3 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"right:0.75rem;bottom:0.75rem;delay:240ms;background:#EB4203;opacity:0;transform:scale(0);transition-delay:240ms\"></span><div class=\"relative mx-auto mb-5 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full\" style=\"background:#fff1ef;transition:background 0.3s ease, transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full\" style=\"border:2px solid #EB4203;opacity:0;animation:none\"></span><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EB4203\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"animation:none;transition:stroke 0.3s ease\"><path d=\"M12 16V4\"></path><path d=\"m6 10 6-6 6 6\"></path><path d=\"M20 16v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Drop image or click to upload</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm transition-opacity duration-300\" style=\"opacity:0.6\">PNG, JPG, WEBP · max 1 file</p><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" class=\"hidden\"/></div></div><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Remove an image background online for free and download a transparent PNG with no account or BgRemove watermark. Processing happens in your browser; the export uses a 3840 × 2160 canvas, which does not add detail to a small original.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\" style=\"background:#ffe6e1\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px]\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">How to Remove Background from an Image</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-base\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Choose an image, review the cutout, and download a transparent PNG.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-sm font-black text-white\" style=\"background:#EB4203\">01</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Upload your image</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Choose a PNG, JPG, or WEBP image from your device. No account is required.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-sm font-black text-white\" style=\"background:#EB4203\">02</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">AI removes the background</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">An on-device model creates a cutout in your browser. Processing time depends on the image and your device.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-sm font-black text-white\" style=\"background:#EB4203\">03</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Download or edit the PNG</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Download a transparent PNG on a 3840 × 2160 canvas, or open the editor to crop it and choose transparent, white, black, or brand-color backgrounds.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px]\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Why Use BgRemove?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-base\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">An online background remover that processes your selected image in your browser.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border bg-white/60 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\">⚡</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Remove a background online</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Choose an image and let the browser-based model create a cutout. Processing time depends on your image and device.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border bg-white/60 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\">🔒</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Image processing in your browser</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">The selected image is processed on your device rather than sent to BgRemove for background removal.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border bg-white/60 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\">🖼️</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Transparent PNG download</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Download a PNG on a 3840 × 2160 canvas. Upscaling a small source does not add image detail.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border bg-white/60 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\">🆓</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Free to use, no account</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Use the tool without creating an account. BgRemove does not add a watermark to the PNG.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border bg-white/60 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\">📱</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Works everywhere</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Desktop, tablet, or mobile — any modern browser. No app install required.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border bg-white/60 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\">🎯</div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Review the cutout</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Results vary with the source image. Check fine edges and details before using the PNG in a final design.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\" style=\"background:#ffe6e1\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px]\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">What Can You Use It For?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-base\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">From e-commerce listings to ID photos — background removal for every use case.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">E-commerce product photos</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Create a transparent cutout for a product listing, then check the marketplace&#x27;s current image rules before publishing.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">ID card &amp; passport photos</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Prepare a cutout locally in your browser. Check the issuing authority&#x27;s current photo rules for background color, framing, and dimensions before submitting.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Social media &amp; thumbnails</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Cut out people or products for YouTube thumbnails, Instagram posts, and ad creatives. Drop the transparent PNG onto any brand background.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Design &amp; marketing assets</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Isolate subjects for banners, presentations, mockups, and print materials. No Photoshop subscription required.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Real estate &amp; listings</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Create cutouts for listing images and layouts. Review the result against the original before publishing.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/70 p-6 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"border:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-base font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Personal projects</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Profile pictures, stickers, invitations, school projects — anything where you want the subject to stand out on a clean background.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[900px]\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">What to Expect from the Download</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-base\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">A quick overview of what the tool does and what its output means.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white/70\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-sm\"><thead><tr style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.08)\"><th class=\"px-5 py-4 font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Feature</th><th class=\"px-5 py-4 font-bold\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">BgRemove</th><th class=\"px-5 py-4 font-semibold\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">What to know</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"color:#3d2f2c\"><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.10);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-medium\">Price</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-bold\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">Free to use</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5\">No account required</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.10);background:transparent\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-medium\">Input formats</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-bold\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">PNG, JPG, WEBP</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5\">Choose a supported image</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.10);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-medium\">Download</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-bold\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">PNG with transparent background</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5\">No BgRemove watermark</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.10);background:transparent\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-medium\">Canvas</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-bold\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">3840 × 2160 pixels</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5\">Upscaling does not add source detail</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(235,66,3,0.10);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-medium\">Image processing</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 font-bold\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">In your browser</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5\">Website/model files still load in your browser</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\" style=\"background:#ffe6e1\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[800px]\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-base\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Everything you need to know about removing backgrounds with BgRemove.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Can I remove an image background online for free?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Yes. BgRemove is free to use in your browser and does not require an account. The downloaded PNG has no BgRemove watermark.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Is my image uploaded for processing?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">The selected image is processed in your browser using WebAssembly, rather than sent to BgRemove&#x27;s application server. Your browser still requests the website and model files needed to run the tool.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">What does the downloaded PNG contain?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">By default, the cutout is centered on a 3840 × 2160 canvas with transparent space around it. If you choose a solid editor background, the PNG uses that color instead. Enlarging a small original does not restore missing detail.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Can I add a white background instead of transparency?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Yes. After processing, choose Edit &amp; Crop and select White in the background controls. You can also keep the background transparent or choose black or the brand color.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">What image formats are supported?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">The tool accepts PNG, JPG, and WEBP images and downloads a PNG.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Will the cutout preserve every fine edge?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Results depend on the image, subject, contrast, and device. Inspect hair, translucent areas, and similar fine edges; no automatic remover can guarantee a perfect result for every photo.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.18)\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Can I use an edited photo for an ID or passport application?<span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45\" style=\"background:rgba(235,66,3,0.12);color:#EB4203\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">The tool can create a cutout, but photo rules vary by issuing authority and may restrict edits. Check the current official requirements before submitting an edited image.</div></details></div><p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-sm\" style=\"color:#8a7a77\">Still have questions?<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold underline\" style=\"color:#EB4203\" href=\"/about\">Learn more about BgRemove</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[800px] rounded-3xl px-6 py-14 text-center sm:px-12\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #EB4203 0%, #c23300 60%, #0a0a0a 100%)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl\">Ready to remove your background?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-base text-white/80\">Remove the background in your browser and download a transparent PNG, without creating an account.</p><a href=\"#upload\" class=\"mt-8 inline-block rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl active:scale-[0.98]\" style=\"color:#EB4203\">Upload Image Now</a></div></section><section class=\"px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px]\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">Learn more</h2><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/60 p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\" href=\"/blog/how-to-remove-image-background-free\"><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-[#EB4203]\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">How to Remove Image Background for Free</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Step-by-step guide with no signup required.</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border bg-white/60 p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#EB4203] hover:shadow-md\" style=\"border-color:rgba(235,66,3,0.15)\" href=\"/blog/best-free-background-remover-tools-2026\"><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-[#EB4203]\" style=\"color:#0a0a0a\">What to Look for in a Free Background Remover</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-xs\" style=\"color:#5a4a47\">Compare privacy, formats, output, and editing needs.</div></a>