l.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I add a white background instead of transparency?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. After processing, choose Edit & Crop and select White in the background controls. You can also keep the background transparent or choose black or the brand color.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What image formats are supported?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The tool accepts PNG, JPG, and WEBP images and downloads a PNG.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will the cutout preserve every fine edge?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Results depend on the image, subject, contrast, and device. Inspect hair, translucent areas, and similar fine edges; no automatic remover can guarantee a perfect result for every photo.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use an edited photo for an ID or passport application?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The tool can create a cutout, but photo rules vary by issuing authority and may restrict edits. Check the current official requirements before submitting an edited image.\"}}]}c:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2e\"}}]\nd:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"overflow-x-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"upload\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L30\",null,{}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"how-it-works\",\"className\":\"px-4 py-20 sm:px-6\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"#ffe6e1\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-[1100px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-12 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#0a0a0a\"},\"children\":\"How to Remove Background from an Image\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-base\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#5a4a47\"},\"child